Congratulations! You passed your ECBA exam, and you’re officially certified!
All the studying, planning, and persistence have really paid off—this is a big step forward in your professional journey. Now you might be wondering, “What’s next?”
As a newly minted IIBA member, you’re joining a global community 30,000 strong—business analysis professionals who are growing, sharing, and shaping the future of the profession. Let’s take a look at how to make the most of your certification and IIBA membership.
FIND YOUR BADGE AND CERTIFICATE:
Now that you’ve successfully passed the exam, your name will appear within the Digital Badge Program and Certified Professional Directory (unless you opted out).
